'PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">腾讯发布实时语音模型Hy Realtime，支持Agentic工具调用与唱歌功能</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">04</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">独立开发者利用Claude Code完成三元哥德巴赫猜想形式化证明</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">05</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">Anthropic 募资 904 亿剑指史上最大 IPO，认购已超六倍</span></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:10px auto;text-align:center;\"><section style=\"display:inline-block;\"><section style=\"margin-top:-4px;padding:0 40px;outline:0;font-size:24px;letter-spacing:1.5px;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\">新闻速览</span></strong></section><section style=\"margin-top:-2px;width:182px;height:2px;background-color:rgb(58,19,228);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"margin-top:3px;width:182px;height:1px;background-color:rgb(111,19,209);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"outline:0;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:1.5px;color:rgb(92,11,214);transform:scale(.9);\"><span leaf=\"\">NEWS GLANCE</span></section></section></section><section id=\"xiangqing\"><section id=\"content1\"><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">马斯克等科技高管联名请愿要求英伟达恢复黄仁勋CEO职务</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/72709a726a98058f9569f50f2f4f0056.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">埃隆·马斯克等科技高管近日发起联名请愿，要求英伟达董事会恢复黄仁勋的CEO职务。截至11月16日下午，该请愿书已获超11.5万个签名，涵盖5965名英伟达现任员工、1108名前员工及63063名股东。支持者包括特斯拉、SpaceX、Replit、Epic Games及Y Combinator等公司CEO。黄仁勋于11月12日辞职，英伟达随后任命CFO科莱特·克雷斯担任临时CEO。请愿书质疑免职程序的正当性，要求在独立调查期间恢复其职务并披露更多信息。此人事变动已导致英伟达股价本周大幅下跌，并引发市场对AI初创企业融资生态及行业投资活动的担忧。此次联名行动凸显了黄仁勋在AI产业生态中的核心影响力，使该事件从单一公司治理问题演变为影响资本市场与AI技术发展的行业焦点。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">苹果计划于2027年WWDC发布首款代号N50的AI智能眼镜</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/6966a0a6588676ea07ac46e8d14ff7b2.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">苹果计划在2027年6月的WWDC全球开发者大会上发布首款AI智能眼镜，内部代号为N50，预计于2027年底前正式上市。该产品硬件设计已基本定型，外观较Meta第二代Ray-Ban智能眼镜更纤薄，摄像头集成于镜框内部。功能上，该设备不采用传统AR显示方案，而是以AI语音助手Siri为核心交互，通过摄像头感知环境，支持建筑识别、实时翻译、导航指引及食材识别推荐菜谱等功能。用户可通过语音指令完成餐厅预订、网约车呼叫及票务购买等操作，旨在减少对iPhone的依赖。苹果通过此举探索将AI助手、环境感知与生活服务整合进轻量化可穿戴设备的全新交互形态，重点优化了音质、传感器配置及佩戴体验。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">腾讯发布实时语音模型Hy Realtime，支持Agentic工具调用与唱歌功能</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/95a0012445ce86041be0d1531a50a629.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">腾讯混元正式发布全新实时语音模型Hy Realtime，该模型在语音理解、指令遵循及拟人化表达方面表现优异，并新增Agentic工具调用与唱歌功能。Hy Realtime不仅能实现实时对话，还具备联网搜索等主动执行任务的能力，标志着其从单纯的语音应答向具备工具操作能力的智能体演进。目前，该模型已集成至元宝语音通话及腾讯客服等内部产品中，显著提升了数亿用户的交互体验。腾讯计划近期将Hy Realtime通过API形式接入腾讯云，向外部开发者开放。此举意味着腾讯将其自研语音技术能力从内部场景正式推向外部市场，打破了此前该类能力多依赖第三方供应商的局面，为开发者提供更具竞争力的实时语音交互解决方案。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">独立开发者利用Claude Code完成三元哥德巴赫猜想形式化证明</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/b7981a991e67d57eb6ac49ba002353ea.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">独立开发者Charlie Reams近日借助Claude Code成功完成了对三元哥德巴赫猜想的形式化证明，累计产出19.4万行Lean4代码，且所有数学推理均通过机器严格验证。在证明过程中，Claude Code展现了极高的严谨性，自主识别并修复了数学家Harald Helfgott于2013年原版证明中的11处关键漏洞，涵盖常数错误、不等式失效及引用偏差等问题。此外，该项目将证明依赖的外部假设从5项精简至2项，显著提升了严谨性。此次突破标志着数学界正从传统的同行评议向完全依赖机器可验证的形式化证明范式转变，证明了AI在基础科学研究领域处理复杂逻辑推理的强大潜力。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">Anthropic 募资 904 亿剑指史上最大 IPO，认购已超六倍</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/802f3f27d16f0ba7d0e1fd743e3d256f.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">Anthropic 募资 904 亿剑指史上最大 IPO，认购已超六倍AIbase基地发布于AI新闻资讯 · 1 分钟阅读 · Nov 13, 202612据知情人士透露，Claude 开发商 Anthropic 的 IPO 已吸引到可供认购股票约六倍的订单，投资者对这桩有望成为有史以来最大股票发行的热情持续升温。招股文件显示，公司连同联合创始人计划借 IPO 最多募得 644 亿美元，再叠加一笔 260 亿美元的非公开配售，双管齐下为登陆公开市场备足弹药。在 AI 投资热潮退潮与否的争论中，真金白银的认购给出了最直白的投票。两项相加，反超 SpaceX 登顶 把 IPO 与私募配售合计，规模最高可达 904 亿美元，一举超过 SpaceX 的上市交易，坐上史上最大上市交易的宝座。</section></section></section></section><section style=\"text-align:center;\"><img data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.4255555555555556\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"900\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\"></section>",
